From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Giga Edge SDK <noreply@giga-edge-sdk.invalid>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:31:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] ggml-cpu: faster q4_0 matmul and flash attention on
 Cortex-A55

An 8-row q4_0 4x4 panel kernel scheduled for the in-order A55, a q4_0 x q8_0
dot product of one x row with 2-4 y rows, and flash attention paths that walk
the KV cells once per group of heads. The new paths are compiled for aarch64
without SVE only, and the results are bitwise identical to the previous
kernels.
